---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title={`About Us | 10Best Living`} description={`Learn about 10Best Living — our mission, team, and editorial process for trusted product reviews.`} path={`/about`}>
  <div class="bg-card">
    <div class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gradient-to-br from-cream via-cream-dark to-cream">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-primary mb-6 leading-tight">About Us</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
      <div class="prose-content text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary" data-aos="fade-up">
<h2 id="sec-1">Our Story</h2>
<p>10Best Living was founded in 2026 with a simple but powerful mission: to help discerning consumers make informed purchasing decisions through rigorous, unbiased product testing and expert analysis.</p>
<p>We believe that quality products deserve to be recognized, and that consumers deserve honest, thorough reviews — not paid endorsements disguised as opinions. Every product we review is purchased with our own funds whenever possible, and we never accept compensation for favorable coverage.</p>

<h2 id="sec-2">Our Editorial Process</h2>
<p>Every review on 10Best Living follows a meticulous editorial process:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Research:</strong> Our team identifies the most relevant products in each category through market analysis, consumer feedback, and industry expertise</li>
<li><strong>Testing:</strong> Products are tested under real-world conditions for a minimum of 30 days. We evaluate performance, durability, ease of use, and value</li>
<li><strong>Comparison:</strong> Each product is benchmarked against direct competitors to establish relative strengths and weaknesses</li>
<li><strong>Scoring:</strong> We use a transparent scoring methodology across 5 key criteria to ensure consistency</li>
<li><strong>Writing:</strong> Our editorial team crafts comprehensive, SEO-optimized reviews that prioritize reader value above all else</li>
<li><strong>Review:</strong> All content undergoes fact-checking and editorial review before publication</li>
<li><strong>Updates:</strong> Reviews are updated regularly as new products enter the market and pricing changes</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="sec-3">Our Team</h2>
<p>10Best Living is staffed by experienced reviewers, writers, and researchers with deep expertise across home goods, fitness, beauty, and technology categories. Our lead reviewers bring an average of 10+ years of product testing experience from leading consumer publications.</p>

<h2 id="sec-4">Our Values</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Integrity:</strong> We maintain complete editorial independence. Affiliate commissions never influence our rankings</li>
<li><strong>Thoroughness:</strong> We test every product long enough to identify both strengths and flaws</li>
<li><strong>Transparency:</strong> We disclose our affiliate relationships clearly and consistently</li>
<li><strong>Accessibility:</strong> We cover a range of price points so every reader can find the right choice</li>
<li><strong>Continuous Improvement:</strong> We update our reviews as new information becomes available</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="sec-5">Contact Us</h2>
<p>We welcome your questions, suggestions, and feedback. Reach us at <a href="mailto:hello@10bestliving.com" class="text-gold">hello@10bestliving.com</a>.</p>
</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>


